      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/53a042/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2016-10-25T15:15:18.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I think its pretty obvious that its going to miss October. I think they said they would update us if they had a proof from the printer or if it was on a boat (or if it was accidently filled with scorpions) which means none of that has happened yet. Usually the slow boat from China takes 6? or so weeks so I think before Christmas is looking out of the question at this point.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I am interested in an updated release date though.</p>",
